		(property "Description" "VIN_EXT straight to VIN_BUS, < 10 mW at 1 A. Blocks the boost output: ~2 µA cathode leakage (a Schottky would lift VIN_EXT_P, turn Q9 on and fake a VIN_EXT); a reversed VIN_EXT with the boost running puts 48.5 V across Q10 (60 V) and cathode to anode (75 V). Input decoupling: C2"
			(at 275.59 208.28 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left)
